# the same `body_op0` id comes back created and a volume is still reported. A
# generator source re-runs deterministically, so detach is indistinguishable from a
# static copy; the exact volume (never an NDJSON literal — numbers compare exactly)
# and placed==detached equality belong to worker/tests/test_component_ops.cpp.
